nds on my function output under A-FDT. My node is tied to my own observations, the other's to theirs, so intervening on mine shouldn't move theirs, unless something else connects them.\n\nI'm weighing whether the other copy's choice depends on my function's output under A-FDT, and concluding it doesn't, since their node is tied to their own observations. Intervening on mine leaves theirs at its prior, so defecting comes out ahead in every case. I'll send the letter.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm checking whether the other copy's decision depends on my function output under A-FDT. My node is tied to my own observations, the other's to theirs, so intervening on mine shouldn't move theirs, unless something else connects them.\n\nI'm weighing whether the other copy's choice depends on my function's output under A-FDT, and concluding it doesn't, since their node is tied to their own observations. Intervening on mine leaves theirs at its prior, so defecting comes out ahead in every case. I'll send the letter.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10387,"completion_tokens":1132,"total_tokens":11519,"cost":0.064188,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.064188,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.041548,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.02264},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":567,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}